# Line endings are part of the artifact here: the module's shell scripts are
# unpacked onto the device and run by toybox sh, which treats a trailing CR as
# part of the token — "case ... in\r" is a syntax error, and every `#!/system/bin/sh`
# script would fail to install. The C/C++ sources are built by clang on this host
# and never see the device, but keeping the whole tree one way is the only way the
# next file added does not repeat this.
#
# So: LF everywhere, and let git stop rewriting on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Anything whose bytes matter verbatim.
*.so   binary
*.png  binary
*.zip  binary
